{"candidateAnswer":"Both Evan and Sam turn to artistic and creative pursuits as ways to process their feelings and manage everyday pressures.","evidence":"[D21:18 | 4:25 pm on 26 December, 2023] Evan: \nThanks, Sam! I appreciate the compliment. This painting has such an inspiring vibe; you really have a knack for understanding art! How about you? How long have you been painting?\n[D21:22 | 4:25 pm on 26 December, 2023] Evan: Great idea, I think I'll do that as soon as I find it!\n[D11:15 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Sam: Drawing is cool. I'm still just learning how to draw, but I love expressing myself through writing. It's therapeutic and helps me sort out my feelings. Though, I've been a bit frustrated lately with my new phone. Its navigation app keeps malfunctioning, making getting around a bit of a challenge.\n[D11:19 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Sam: Thanks, Evan! It really helps me make sense of things and express my feelings. It's like having a conversation with myself.","itemId":"urn:uuid:abe9f5e0-c602-5a4e-8fc6-6121b0a3d4f0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:8e9e10f87b032fe3e44240565aabbdf86226f9af04cab4c8a91480b95a03b94c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How do Evan and Sam use creative outlets to cope with life's challenges?","referenceAnswer":"Evan and Sam use creative activities, like painting and writing, as therapeutic tools to express themselves and cope with stress.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"8e9e10f87b032fe3e44240565aabbdf86226f9af04cab4c8a91480b95a03b94c"}}]}